<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;"><br>We have your RSVP and are looking forward to seeing you this Wednesday at Mayor Ginther's State of the City address!</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;"> </p>
<p style="text-align: center; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;" align="center"><strong>2025 State of the City Address<br></strong><strong>Wednesday, April 16</strong></p>
<p style="text-align: center; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;" align="center"><strong>Fort Hayes Metropolitan Education Center<br></strong><strong>546 Jack Gibbs Blvd, Columbus, OH<br></strong><strong>Performing Arts Theater</strong></p>
<p style="text-align: center; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;" align="center"><strong> </strong><strong>Doors Open: 5:30 pm<br></strong><strong>Address Begins: 6:00 pm</strong></p>
<p style="text-align: center; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;" align="center"> </p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 15px;">Please give yourself time to navigate the Fort Hayes campus. Free parking is available in the lot in front of the Shot Tower, the Arts Impact Middle School and behind the Business Building. Look for Mobile City Hall and city staff to find your way to the auditorium.</p>
<img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2025/03/11306653/forthayesmap_original.png" style="width: 590px; height: auto; -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic; line-height: 1; outline: none; text-decoration: none; max-width: 100%; border: none;" alt="Map of Fort Hayes Education Center campus" width="590" height="590">
